   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Labour Organization (ILO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced labour market statistics and Labour Market Information System (LMIS) in KSA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO has been supporting the Ministry of Human Resource and Social Development (MHRSD)in the implementation and operationalization of a Labour Market Information System. Continued ILO support to ensure regular updates and upgrades of the system will be useful for its effective and useful functioning. The system shall be running providing up-to-date data and information useful for policy development, monitoring and evaluation. Building capacities of MHRSD staff to analyze data and indicators provided by this system would also be needed.</narrative>
  </description>
